            <div xml:id="d248-a4">

                <pb facs="0436" n="376" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg376"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">John Seys:</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Providence has so arranged that you have
                    been appointed minister resident to this republic by that magnanimous nation
                    which you have the distinguished honor to represent; and be you assured, sir,
                    that our interest in your nation generated in consequence of your unrelenting
                    zeal for the promotion and perpetuation of that feeling of friendship and
                    commercial intercourse between this and your nation is of parallel <pb
                        facs="0437" n="377" xml:id="pg377"/> growth with this republic. May your
                    residence in this republic continue to prove a blessing to us as well as highly
                    promotive to your health and happiness. We thank God that you are minister
                    resident here. We are happy to have you visit the senate of the republic of
                    Liberia.</p>
            </div>
